borrow.tree
├── when market is paused
│   └── it should revert with MarketPaused
├── when market is frozen
│   └── it should revert with MarketFrozen
└── when market is not paused and not frozen
    ├── when assets and shares are both zero
    │   └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketInvalidInput
    ├── when assets and shares are both non-zero
    │   └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketInvalidInput
    ├── when receiver is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketInvalidInput
    └── when inputs are valid
        ├── given position would exceed max LTV
        │   └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketBorrowingTooMuch
        ├── given borrow amount exceeds debt ceiling
        │   └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketInsufficientMarketLiquidity
        └── given borrow is within limits
            ├── when data length is zero
            │   ├── it should mint borrow tokens to receiver
            │   ├── it should increase totalBorrowed
            │   ├── it should increase position borrowShares
            │   ├── it should apply opening fee to claimableFeesAssets
            │   └── it should emit Borrow event
            ├── when data length is greater than zero and receiver is authorized callback
            │   ├── it should mint borrow tokens to receiver
            │   ├── it should increase totalBorrowed
            │   ├── it should increase position borrowShares
            │   ├── it should apply opening fee to claimableFeesAssets
            │   ├── it should call onBorrow callback
            │   └── it should emit Borrow event
            └── when data length is greater than zero and receiver is not authorized callback
                └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketUnauthorized 